# The expression grammar. NOT LR(0): states with a complete item AND a shift
# (e.g.  T -> F .  together with nothing to shift is fine, but  E -> T .
# together with  T -> T . * F  is a shift/reduce conflict on '*'). SLR (Module
# 32) resolves it with FOLLOW.
%start E
E -> E plus T | T
T -> T star F | F
F -> lp E rp | id
